From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: attrr <110731994+attrr@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Tue, 10 Nov 2026 17:18:23 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] clk: qcom: dispcc-sm8250: don't park the MDP clock at
 registration

The bootloader's display still scans out its splash when dispcc probes,
from PLL0. Parking the MDP RCG on XO under it underflows a frame, colour
blocks across the screen, and then stalls it until msm takes over.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
---
 drivers/clk/qcom/dispcc-sm8250.c | 2 +-
 1 file changed, 1 insertion(+), 1 deletion(-)

diff --git a/drivers/clk/qcom/dispcc-sm8250.c b/drivers/clk/qcom/dispcc-sm8250.c
index 8f433e1e7028..23b79031bbc9 100644
--- a/drivers/clk/qcom/dispcc-sm8250.c
+++ b/drivers/clk/qcom/dispcc-sm8250.c
@@ -565,7 +565,7 @@ static struct clk_rcg2 disp_cc_mdss_mdp_clk_src = {
 		.parent_data = disp_cc_parent_data_5,
 		.num_parents = ARRAY_SIZE(disp_cc_parent_data_5),
 		.flags = CLK_SET_RATE_PARENT,
-		.ops = &clk_rcg2_shared_ops,
+		.ops = &clk_rcg2_shared_no_init_park_ops,
 	},
 };
 
